{# app/views/_includes/reading/read-opinion-tag.njk

   The single way to show one read's opinion as a tag. Colour is reserved for
   the case outcome, so a read shown as context is always grey; a blinded read
   shows "Completed" without revealing the opinion. Bylines, reveal links and
   not-read fallbacks stay with the caller - this is just the tag.

   Set before including:
   - readOpinionRead - the read (required)
   - readOpinionContext - 'own' shows the viewer's own opinion in full colour;
     anything else (or unset) is another reader's opinion, shown grey
   - readOpinionBlinded - true hides the opinion behind a grey "Completed"
   - readOpinionShowFinalisation - true adds a caption with the read's
     finalisation state: "Unfinalised" while pending, "Finalised {time}" after.
     'unfinalised' captions only the pending state - for contexts that already
     show the finalised time elsewhere, like the case view
   - readOpinionForceUnfinalised - treat the read as unfinalised whatever
     isReadFinalised says (for callers with their own wider condition)

   The option locals are reset at the end so they can't leak between rows. #}

{% if readOpinionBlinded %}
  {{ "Completed" | toTag({ colour: "grey" }) }}
{% elseif readOpinionContext == 'own' %}
  {{ readOpinionRead.opinion | toTag }}
{% else %}
  {{ readOpinionRead.opinion | toTag({ colour: "grey" }) }}
{% endif %}

{% if readOpinionShowFinalisation and not readOpinionBlinded %}
  {% set readOpinionIsFinalised = (readOpinionRead | isReadFinalised(data.settings)) and not readOpinionForceUnfinalised %}
  {% if not readOpinionIsFinalised %}
    <br><span class="nhsuk-u-secondary-text-colour app-nowrap nhsuk-body-s nhsuk-u-margin-bottom-0">Unfinalised</span>
  {% elseif readOpinionShowFinalisation != 'unfinalised' %}
    {% set readOpinionFinalisedAt = readOpinionRead.finalisedAt or (readOpinionRead | getAutoFinaliseTime(data.settings)) %}
    {% if readOpinionFinalisedAt %}
      <br><span class="nhsuk-u-secondary-text-colour app-nowrap nhsuk-body-s nhsuk-u-margin-bottom-0">Finalised {{ readOpinionFinalisedAt | formatTimeString }}</span>
    {% endif %}
  {% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% set readOpinionContext = null %}
{% set readOpinionBlinded = null %}
{% set readOpinionShowFinalisation = null %}
{% set readOpinionForceUnfinalised = null %}
